OL,3,GNEWSAHospital admin roles threatened in
OL,4,A#90m cuts plan                         
OL,6,FAn NHS hospital trust is reviewing     
OL,7,Fadministrative and clerical roles as it
OL,8,Flooks to cut #90m in costs.            
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals Tees, which covers
OL,11,FNorth and South Tees NHS Foundation    
OL,12,FTrusts, previously announced it is     
OL,13,Fpreparing to cut up to 550 roles.      
OL,15,FIts chief delivery officer Russell     
OL,16,FNightingale said any proposed changes  
OL,17,Fwill be "subject to formal consultation
OL,18,Fwith affected staff and trade union    
OL,19,Frepresentatives" and would "primarily" 
OL,20,Fcome through not filling vacancies and 
OL,21,Fvoluntary measures.                    
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
