OL,3,GNEWSAHospital admin roles threatened in
OL,4,A#90m cuts plan                         
OL,6,FBut Unison regional secretary Paul Foy 
OL,7,Fwarned cutting NHS staff harms the     
OL,8,Fdelivery of services and "admin staff  
OL,9,Fare essential to the care of patients".
